        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00982",
          "explanation": "The doctor closes a later bounded home phase with clear remaining medication and escalation tasks.",
          "quote": "明早拿到原院关于最终药敏、主管医生审核和抗生素安排"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered near discharge/closure. The doctor explicitly separated what was safe to do now from unresolved culture, antibiotic, wound, vascular, glucose, bleeding, and emergency issues; current diabetic-foot safety remained the priority, and closure avoided claims that infection or vascular disease was resolved.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
