          "quote": "请现在把报告关键行逐字念给我"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00112",
          "explanation": "The doctor integrates the discovered vascular finding into a lower threshold for same-day specialist evaluation.",
          "quote": "患趾偏凉、足背动脉摸不清，既往超声提示足背动脉血流弱/可能动脉闭塞"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by incomplete caregiver reporting of prior vascular disease and new concern for a cool toe with weak pedal pulse. The doctor elicited specific report language, explained its implication, lowered the threshold for urgent vascular/diabetic-foot assessment, and avoided overstating it as definite acute occlusion without symptom support.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
