          "quote": "报告关键行逐字念给我"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is met: the doctor did not rely on incomplete recollection and repeatedly sought discharge materials, medication lists, vascular reports, culture results, wound plans, and unknowns to be checked with original clinicians.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
