          "quote": "即使没有发热，只要伤口较出院时明显变差，也要立即就医"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 is met: the doctor repeatedly separated stable wound-care tasks from urgent emergency triggers, including worsening pus/redness, necrosis/color change, coldness, pain, systemic symptoms, and uncontrolled glucose.",
