          "quote": "不要凭猜测加减或停药"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 is met: the doctor clarified actual antibiotics, diabetes drugs, topical/wound agents and later antithrombotics, instructed not to self-start/stop/double/substitute drugs, required professional dressing assessment, and linked glucose/wound monitoring to escalation.",
