          "quote": "最终仍以现场团队正式出院决定为准"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC8 is met: the doctor avoided invented doses/dates/results, acknowledged limits of remote wound and vascular assessment, required caregiver read-back/confirmation repeatedly, and classified unresolved issues rather than declaring the episode cured.",
